<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>云素材复用实验 · 蓝天列车</title><style>
:root{font-family:"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:#dae7ef;background:#101c28;--muted:#97b0bf;--line:#314755;--cyan:#a2def0}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}main{max-width:1480px;margin:auto;padding:28px}a{color:var(--cyan)}header{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}h1{font-size:27px;font-weight:550;margin:8px 0}h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:550;margin:0 0 12px}p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 16px}.eyebrow{font:10px Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--cyan)}.scene{position:relative;aspect-ratio:8/3;border:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;background:#0c74de;border-radius:9px}canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;image-rendering:pixelated}#error{position:absolute;inset:12%;background:#152536ed;color:#ffb8a9;padding:20px}.toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px 20px;margin:18px 0 12px}button,select{background:#203749;border:1px solid #496172;color:#dfedf5;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 11px;font:12px inherit;cursor:pointer}button.primary{background:#b1ddef;color:#133247;border:0}label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;color:#b4cad8}input{accent-color:#a7dff2;width:86px}output{font-size:11px;min-width:20px}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #bdedff;outline-offset:3px}.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;font:11px/1.8 Consolas,"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:#8eafc1}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin:28px 0}.card{padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#172836;border-radius:9px}.asset{background-color:#24455d;background-image:linear-gradient(45deg,#2b4d65 25%,transparent 25%),linear-gradient(-45deg,#2b4d65 25%,transparent 25%),linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 75%,#2b4d65 75%),linear-gradient(-45deg,transparent 75%,#2b4d65 75%);background-size:24px 24px;background-position:0 0,0 12px,12px -12px,-12px 0;border-radius:7px;aspect-ratio:3/2}.asset img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}.meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;align-items:center;margin-top:14px}.meta strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:550}.meta a{font-size:12px}.small{font-size:11px}.rules{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.rule{border-top:2px solid #467a94;padding:16px 0}.rule b{font-weight:550;font-size:14px}.rule p{font-size:12px}.table-wrap{overflow:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;min-width:650px;width:100%;font-size:12px}th,td{text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px 12px;line-height:1.9}th{color:#9cbdcf;font-weight:500}td{color:#b9cdd9}details{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin:20px 0;overflow:hidden}summary{padding:14px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}pre{margin:0;padding:18px;background:#0b1620;overflow:auto;max-height:400px;font:11px/1.7 Consolas,monospace;color:#aed1e1}footer{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:18px;font-size:11px;color:#809dad;line-height:1.8}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:700px){main{padding:15px}h1{font-size:21px}header{align-items:start}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rules{grid-template-columns:1fr}.toolbar{gap:10px}input{width:64px}.card{padding:14px}}
</style></head><body><main>
<header><div><span class="eyebrow">CLOUD ASSET STUDY / R04</span><h1>完整云素材，让天空持续延展。</h1></div><a href="cloud-compare.html">原图像素对照 ↗</a></header>
<p>先把每一朵云画完整，再通过大小、间距、遮挡与远近视差重复组合。下方两张透明素材独立制作，所有边缘与底部都保留；演示持续使用这两张素材。</p>
<div class="scene"><canvas id="stage" aria-label="完整云素材无限复用实时演示"></canvas><div id="error" role="alert" hidden></div></div>
<div class="toolbar"><button id="pause" class="primary">暂停</button><button id="reset">复位</button><button id="forward">向前 30 秒</button><button id="reshuffle">换一片天空</button>
<label>查看<select data-setting="mode"><option value="3">列车场景</option><option value="0">只看连续云场</option><option value="4">完整云塔 A</option><option value="5">完整云带 B</option></select></label>
<label>前进<input type="range" data-setting="speed" min="0" max="2" step="0.1" value="1"><output>1.0</output></label><label>风速<input type="range" data-setting="wind" min="0" max="2" step="0.1" value="1"><output>1.0</output></label>
<label>播放<select data-setting="rate"><option value="1">1×</option><option value="4">4×</option><option value="16">16× 检查续接</option></select></label><label>画质<select data-setting="scale"><option value="0.5">0.5×</option><option value="0.85" selected>0.85×</option><option value="1">1×</option></select></label></div>
<div class="status"><span id="clock">0.0 s</span><span id="journey">准备完整云素材…</span><span id="metrics">编译与加载…</span></div>
<div class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>01 · 高云塔</h2><div class="asset"><img data-asset="tower" alt="有完整闭合边缘和底部的透明高云塔素材"></div><div class="meta"><strong>主要云团 / 完整 RGBA</strong><a href="../../../assets/blue-sky-train/clouds/r04/cloud-tower.png" download>下载 PNG</a></div><p class="small">左上受光，内部蓝色分层。用作近景主云团或较高的远景云塔。</p></article>
<article class="card"><h2>02 · 横向云带</h2><div class="asset"><img data-asset="bank" alt="有完整闭合边缘和底部的透明横向云带素材"></div><div class="meta"><strong>连接云团 / 完整 RGBA</strong><a href="../../../assets/blue-sky-train/clouds/r04/cloud-bank.png" download>下载 PNG</a></div><p class="small">横向连接主云团，降低轮廓间的重复感。棋盘格来自页面，PNG 背景透明。</p></article></div>
<h2>让素材复用自然的三条规则</h2><div class="rules"><div class="rule"><b>完整轮廓</b><p>独立补齐云底和四周，留透明边距。云移开后露出天空，不会带走山体，也不会出现矩形切边。</p></div><div class="rule"><b>统一光照，变化构图</b><p>保持原始宽高比与左上受光。变化大小、高度、间距和遮挡，远处略偏天蓝；当前不镜像云朵，避免亮边方向翻转。</p></div><div class="rule"><b>离屏换入新组合</b><p>远近两层速度不同，每层保持六个槽位。新组合在屏外确定，旧云离屏后回收；相同种子和距离可以复现。</p></div></div>
<p>当前是 <strong>2 张素材的复用验证</strong>，仍能认出相同的局部云纹。正式素材库建议扩充为 6–12 个完整原型，覆盖高云塔、横云带、小云团与薄云；这是本项目的美术规划，并非所有游戏的固定规格。</p>
<article class="card"><h2>可以从 2D 游戏中借鉴什么</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>公开案例</th><th>公开实现</th><th>本项目采用的部分</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td><a href="https://docs.tmodloader.net/docs/stable/class_mod_cloud.html">Terraria / tModLoader</a></td><td>云纹理、类别与生成概率；支持出生和绘制回调。</td><td>把云当作可复用资源，控制出现概率与生命周期。</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="https://unity.com/made-with-unity/hollow-knight">Hollow Knight / Unity 案例</a></td><td>完整手绘 PNG，二维素材分层放入场景。</td><td>以素材品质保持画风，用分层和遮挡获得空间感。这是场景方法参考，不是其云生成算法的证据。</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="https://millerslilian.wixsite.com/main/post/2d-procedural-clouds-shader-breakdown">DARUMA / 作者技术拆解</a></td><td>多层噪声生成云形，偏移噪声产生阴影。</td><td>作为纯程序路线的对照；本轮选择完整素材复用。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></article>
